# ADR-0600 root-workspace-hygiene: the born-blocking self-test over the live tracked-path corpus.
# It loads the committed allowlist policy + the producer's git-ls-files snapshot
# (scm-facts.generated.json), asserts the gate is GREEN on today's clean allowlisted root tree,
# and proves a tracked `foo.log` injected at root is born-blocking RED (the make-impossible
# guarantee). HERMETIC: the test execs the buck2-BUILT producer to materialize scm-facts (no
# `cargo run`); the producer reads the committed scm-facts face (a declared input) — no git in the
# action. G-INTEGRITY track: no build-graph dep on the firewall.
rust_test(
    name = "oya-cloud-ci-root-workspace-hygiene-app-gate",
    srcs = glob(["tests/**/*.rs"]),
    crate = "oya_cloud_ci_root_workspace_hygiene_app_corpus",
